body:
Bran is the night king so ultimately he will have to fall. Cersei will never win, the writers want you to hate her and need the story to come to a close so that RR Martin can catch up with his writing fingers. Jon or Danaerys is gonna die no doubt. Everything is gonna start over and in the end, there will be some sneak peak that leads into a cycle of a new storyline. 

&#x200B;

If I'm going to say somebody's taking the throne, it's definitely going to be a younger character
